    "title": "OpenAI and Meta push AI agents into sensitive tasks",
    "summary": "The integration of AI agents into sensitive tasks could redefine workplace efficiency but raises critical questions about trust and regulation.\nThe post OpenAI and Meta push AI agents into sensitive tasks appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/openai-meta-ai-agents-sensitive-tasks/",
